note y[i] = a*x[i] + y[i]: one element, the work of one CUDA thread.
fn axpy a long x long y long to long
ret add mul a x y
end
note The grid: elements lo to hi-1, with x[i] = i and y[i] = 2i+1 generated in place.
note Returns the sum of the results so a host can check every element.
fn run a long lo long hi long to long
s = long 0
i = lo
while lt i hi bound 999999
s = add s axpy a i add mul long 2 i long 1
i = add i long 1
end
ret s
end
